        <activityName xml:lang="en">Aluminium oxide, plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Aluminium oxide, plant
Medium sized plant. Output: 800'000 t/a, life time: 50 years;
UUID: e4fa91dd-1cd1-39aa-a630-9eb7f4e7d491
Part of the Al2O3 plant needed only for Al2O3 fabrication (= calcination and Al2O3 storage) including disposal
Location: Some Swiss datasets are used for European processes.
Technology: Technology of one medium sized plant in Germany
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Internet search 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is adjusted for geographical mismatch (using the pedigree matrix).
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e4fa91dd-1cd1-39aa-a630-9eb7f4e7d491.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
